          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "CORNER HAIL 1. 5252                                                   (South Side)                                                   Three Gables TL 0506 2/39              18.6.48. II*                       GV 2. C16 or late C15 house, altered early C17.  Timber frame, tiled roof with 2 red brick chimneystacks of 3 and 4 diagonally set shafts.  2 storeys, oversailing lst floor on moulded wallplate.  Ground floor rebuilt with colour washed cement rendering nearly flush with upper storey.  Close vertical studding with plaster infilling to let floor.  Casement windows. Nos 9 to 11 (consec) form a group with Three Gables. Garden Wall to Three Gables and No 5O, Lawn Lane. Listing NGR: TL0562206140"
    }
